# xfs only: see exclude.common for the rule.
# the reason after a hash. Only tests that cannot run safely or sensibly in this environment belong here; a test that
# merely fails is NOT excluded (it is listed in the report as failing on both, or as a Lunix defect).
# The list is empty on purpose until a reference run on the gate disk shows a test that hangs or damages the host;
# `-x dangerous` already removes the group xfstests itself marks as able to harm the machine.
